5,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Since we're finally settling this, let's be logical. I'm interested in the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks. We need to know what's actually leaking into our workspace.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree that we should be careful. I'd like to see the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the quotes for the two fit-outs. I think it's important to know the costs.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually using the room! I'll look at the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge. That'll show who's being messy!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to consider the heart of our interactions. I shall look into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened. We must ensure we have a space for the soul.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand the actual labor involved. I will look into the facilities callouts on this floor and the round trip for a hot lunch.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, costs are one thing, but efficiency is another. If the room is a nuisance, the cheapest option is still a waste. Does everyone agree on these choices, or is there overlap we missed?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think the choices are fine. I just don't want us to agree to something we can't actually afford or that keeps costing us more every month. I'm okay with these.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I think it's great! We're all looking at different things, so we'll have a big puzzle to put together. I can't wait to see who the messy people are!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Rin. Curiosity is a wonderful engine for discovery. Let us hope that what we find allows us to build a bridge toward one another, rather than a wall.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,The distribution of research is balanced. There is no need for overlap if we trust each other to report the facts accurately. I am satisfied with these selections.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Since we've all agreed, I see no reason to linger. Let's move forward and get the data. I'm curious to see if the physical reality matches the complaints I've heard.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the numbers are clear. I just want to make sure we don't make a mistake that we'll regret later. I'm ready to see the results.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to find out everything! Let's go look at the lists right now! I bet the fridge was super gross!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience, little one. The truth reveals itself in its own time. I look forward to hearing what each of you discovers, for every piece of information is a thread in the fabric of our community.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
