60,3,1,talk,Shion,,"The consensus seems clear. A Meeting Space addresses the financial drain, the lack of privacy, and the labor concerns. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It's the best way to stop the monthly rental costs and it seems like the most sustainable choice for everyone. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I'll go with Option B too! As long as we all get a turn to use it and it doesn't become a mess, it sounds like a good plan!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,My heart is at peace with this decision. Let us use this space to heal our silences and foster true kinship. I cast my vote for Option B.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The evidence is conclusive. Option B minimizes recurring labor and eliminates unnecessary external expenditures. It is the only logical choice for the long term. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
